# Submission-repository .gitignore — narrow, intentional.
#
# This is a NEW spec written for this curated submission package. It is
# NOT copied from the canonical research repository's broad .gitignore
# (which blocks .csv/.xlsx/.ipynb by extension everywhere — inappropriate
# here, since this package's approved aggregate .csv/.xlsx and all 6
# executed .ipynb notebooks are exactly what must be tracked).
#
# Nothing here ignores by extension globally. Everything ignored below is
# either local/runtime/development noise, or a specific future path where
# patient-level or generated data must never be added.

# --- Local Python environments ---------------------------------------------
.venv/
.venv*/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# --- Notebook runtime checkpoints -------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS / editor noise -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Secrets / local temp files ----------------------------------------------
.env
*.pem
*.key
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*~

# --- Never allow raw/private patient data to be added later -----------------
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/controlled/
data/private/
data/patient_level/

# --- Runtime/generated patient-level outputs must never enter this repository
outputs/
preds/
oof_predictions/
